SUMMARY:AI Fatigue\, The pros\, Cons and How do we prepare for more of it
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Postgres\nWe've all seen a little too much AI in Linke
 dIn posts\; AI slop has even become a new classification option on LinkedI
 n.\nAI is an amazing tool to make things in your life better\, but it has 
 serious consequences and problems.\nThis talk will show some of the good t
 hings\, bad things\, and how we should move forward to improve human conne
 ction in the future.\nIf you have felt a little overwhelmed recently with 
 AI in your world come join us for a great discussion on things you can do 
 to feel better.
